OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThe morning will begin cloudy
OL,6,Fbut dry. Bright or sunny spells will
OL,7,Fincrease for most for a time during
OL,8,Fthe afternoon but the Great Glen area
OL,9,Fwill remain cloudy.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FThe evening will continue dry
OL,12,Fwith clear periods for most but cloud
OL,13,Fwill spread east later with rain
OL,14,Ffollowing into the west towards the
OL,15,Fmorning.
OL,16,
OL,17,CFriday:FCloudy with patchy rain in the
OL,18,Fsouthwest but drier elsewhere with
OL,19,Fbright or sunny spells increasing
OL,20,Flater.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
